WEBVTT

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:09.660
We have main engine start 4, 3, 2, 1.

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.240
You're a jerk, Tom!

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.820
Look Celia, we have to follow our passions.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:29.860
You have your robotics and I just want to be awesome in space.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:34.240
Why don't you just admit that you're freaked out by my robot hand?

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.820
I'm not freaked out, but it's...

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.340
All right, fine. I'm freaked out.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:42.320
I'm having nightmares that I'm being chased by these giant robotic claws.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:43.240
Oh, what have I done?

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:44.820
We're done.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:53.480
Robot's memory synced and locked.

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:02.140
This is pretty freaky.

00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:58.520
Shouldn't you be down there?

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.760
I heard you guys talking last night.

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.540
It's not my fault, you know.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:14.400
Are you ready? Of course you're ready. You're a rockstar.

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:20.300
How's it looking, Barley? We should have about ten minutes.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:31.980
Well that's perfect. We're only one! All systems go! Yeah you go! Go! Move your asses! Go! Go! Go!

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:35.720
I love it! Come on! Go!

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:45.800
That's nice. Nothing to worry about. Tom!

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:52.720
Tom, there she is.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:56.180
Now, you love her.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:58.260
She's your passion.

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:00.500
Be tender to her.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:01.960
Be honest.

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:04.080
Be tender.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:07.840
Remind her what love is.

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:09.920
Come on.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:21.340
...

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.840
...

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:37.580
...

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:41.600
...

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:42.360
...

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:44.200
...

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.700
And action!

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.040
Memory override in progress.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.400
You're a jerk, Tom!

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:02.780
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:03.980
Sorry.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:05.300
Sorry.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:20.020
Look Celia, we have to follow our passions.

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:27.460
You have your robotics, and I just want to be awesome in space.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:40.980
Get her coming. Two minutes left.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:41.840
Two minutes.

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:43.420
Speed it up!

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:45.420
Speed it up!

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:49.820
Why don't you just admit that you're freaked out by my robot hand?

00:05:56.540 --> 00:06:02.800
This is Celia. I was young. And a dick. But there's no reason to destroy the world.

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:05.700
Why does she do this?

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.340
We already tried that one.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.340
Come on!

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:14.620
Fireball!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.580
No!

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:22.260
Nooo!

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:24.840
You broke my heart!

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:26.400
I know.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.460
You forgot me on earth.

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:29.620
I know.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:32.060
I should just brush you.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:33.000
Oh, damn.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:39.140
I'm...

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.080
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:50.880
Who'd that lip?

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.860
Where am I for?

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:02.700
This time.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:09.280
Why don't you set?

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:32.040
It's out of time! It's out of time!

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:28.060
Captain, we have to abort!

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:41.080
The world's changed Celia.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:55.920
Maybe we can too.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:59.140
Memory overwrite complete!

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:23.440
You know, there's a lesson to be learned from this.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:26.700
Could have gone worse.

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:13.100
I'm sorry.
